	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nplin3QrkLnTeswWT",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 35, DX 11, IQ 3, HT 14, HP 35, WILL 9, PER 10, FP 14, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7wb29WcXR7yfbNP8",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 60 (offense 25, protection 35), threat tier major, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1mUfhzT78BMVred1",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/giant-shark.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "ni_cq2JlowTJ7n4G0",
			"text": "Independent build total: 57 points of racial traits plus 8 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nlEmb-N6uDp1HB70e",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Giant Shark (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4ReU4EGZWy_132oK",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "napBC-lEcXW0Soxw_",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 1800 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nHEA8rh0E-nBFCDXs",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6; water Move 6, 12 at a sprint (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nH3kUozl1JCtymOUp",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n5h2x_qtBmMLd_QMK",
			"text": "Six metres, which is the SM +3 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nXw5m5izasekBC7wQ",
			"text": "ST from Basic Lift: it carries off a 250 kg piece of whatever it bit."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuSz_OfdQQWg1ALz2",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "ntPkTGLoJIgT7B2ct",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
